ere, and accept it job by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]job (or skip per the rehearsal decision).[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Every workflow that runs on master is green on a tip holding [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]every fix[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]ci-green[dim] · [dim][/dim]after master-reds, steward-retry, core-ci[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ci-green: drive Master Gate, Full CI, CI Telemetry, and the Release [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]steward green on a tip holding every phase commit, repair what is still [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]red, and confirm the steward reports the release PR releasable.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase 0.19.0 is merged, published, verified on PyPI, and [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]recorded as artifacts[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]release[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ci-green, rehearse[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]release: get the release PR merged per the merge_prompt decision, watch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the steward's train to PyPI, verify the published files, and register [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the evidence as SASE artifacts.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1s7","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1s7.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-1s7.1"},"source_run_id":"run-4739d9a5af767de431283af78dd52861","started_at":"2026-11-10T19:41:30.777435+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"d06df77b069d15a1746cbb89c2395b736b6fe527d37f6295775501d4a313ec17","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1s7.5--mon-0/chat.md","size_byt